apps/back/uploads

# Photo originals: the app only references the *-web.jpg versions, so don't ship the full-size
# files (tens of MB, and they'd be publicly downloadable). Name new originals X.jpg and their
# web versions X-web.jpg, or they will be missing from the production image.
apps/web/public/*.jpg
!apps/web/public/*-web.jpg
